[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0993","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0993.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0889","title":"Sun Java 代码签名证书泄露漏洞","description":"Sun Microsystems 的两枚安全代码签名证书遭泄露，攻击者可利用泄露的私钥对恶意代码（如 Java Applet）进行签名，使其伪装为由 Sun 官方签名的可信代码。该漏洞影响所有信任 Sun 代码签名证书的 Java 运行环境及支持 Applet 的浏览器，攻击者可通过网络将恶意签名的 Applet 分发给目标用户，诱使用户在浏览器或 Java 客户端中运行，从而绕过代码签名验证和 Java 安全沙箱检查，在客户端系统中执行任意恶意代码。攻击条件要求攻击者能够获取泄露证书的签名能力并诱导用户执行恶意 Applet，利用门槛较高但危害严重。Sun 已在安全公告 #00198 中发布证书吊销及修复措施，CERT 同步发布 CA-2000-19 安全通告进行预警。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0889"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:40.987","remediation":"立即升级 Java Runtime Environment（JRE）至 Sun 发布的最新补丁版本，在 Java 控制面板中删除受影响的 Sun 签名证书并重新导入新根证书，修改 java.security 配置文件将不信任的证书从 trustStore 中移除，并在防火墙或代理层限制未经签名的 Java Applet 下载执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.Sun.COM/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/198&type=0&nav=sec.sba","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-19.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3dd627d6b90f81690ae15e5d5fb02176cc79caf3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0889.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0889","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0889.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/aa5f2f0cb1791a7f76244bf9f9a0c7e17c4a2f8d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0889.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/292f77a8e015ead047ef178a4e7ea4de6f3945c3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7jhr-h4rw-jq26/GHSA-7jhr-h4rw-jq26.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0889.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88373/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150500_150600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ec9dec1b-cba6-40c6-927c-6c1023735cef.json","https://github.com/Christopher0129/security-knowledge-base/blob/ecec748afe5bbe2fcd2fd04b00fb46bc827b2c5d/system-vulnerabilities/macos.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0993.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1002","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1002.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0899","title":"Max Feoktistov Small HTTP Server 2.01 HTTP Request 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"tags at the end.<value>Small HTTP Server 2.01 是一个轻量级Web服务器，在处理HTTP请求时存在资源耗尽漏洞。攻击者可以通过快速连接服务器并发送大量HTTP请求（如GET、HEAD或POST），然后提前关闭连接，迫使服务器保持连接状态，耗尽系统资源（如文件描述符、内存），最终导致服务器响应速度变慢或完全无法响应，造成服务中断。该漏洞影响当时流行的网络服务器产品，可能导致Web服务不可用。攻击者无需身份验证即可远程触发，攻击成本低且影响范围广。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0899"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:43.133","remediation":"建议立即停止使用 Max Feoktistov Small HTTP Server 2.01，迁移至 Apache HTTP Server 2.4.x、Nginx 1.24+ 或其他现代维护中的 Web 服务器。临时缓解措施：在防火墙层面限制单 IP 连接数（如 iptables 限制每 IP 最大 50 并发）、设置连接超时（如 nginx proxy_read_timeout 30s）、禁用 Keep-Alive 或限制请求头大小，减少资源耗尽风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97421834001092&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1942","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2a4c15d247e2aa1e32bb9712f81631be3a25fb82/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0899.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0899","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0899.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad51007022161bcf4c63e713af3138cc91fa14f3/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0899.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x6wg-8922-rm3c/GHSA-x6wg-8922-rm3c.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0899.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150400_150500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8319933d-b80b-43f0-8213-eb2e68370826.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0899.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1002.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1001","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1001.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0898","title":"Small HTTP Server 服务拒绝漏洞","description":"Small HTTP Server 2.01 版本在处理包含空值的 Server Side Includes (SSI) 标签时存在输入验证缺陷，未正确处理空值导致服务器进程崩溃。本地攻击者可通过上传或植入包含恶意空值 SSI 标签的 HTML 文件，诱使服务器解析时触发空指针解引用或异常处理缺陷，导致 HTTP 服务进程崩溃拒绝服务。远程攻击者若能上传文件或注入 HTML 内容亦可远程触发。该漏洞影响 Small HTTP Server 2.01 版本，CVSS 5.0 (AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P)，属拒绝服务类漏洞，影响服务可用性，厂商已停止维护建议升级替代产品。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0898"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:43.003","remediation":"升级到 Small HTTP Server 2.02 或更高版本，修复 SSI 解析漏洞。修改配置文件，设置 `ssi_enabled=false` 禁用 SSI 功能以降低风险。对于必须保留 SSI 的环境，请添加 SSI 标签输入验证规则，拒绝包含 null 字符的 SSI 指令。配置服务器为 `ssi_parser_strict=true`，强制执行 SSI 指令规范。通过 Web 界面管理员页面设置SSI安全限制，在HTML文件上传时启用SSI安全检查；服务器监控日志记录检测SSI处理异常并及时更新补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97421834001092&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3290bfd28d98351fcc1665e3427425a500ba46e2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0898.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0898","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0898.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad51007022161bcf4c63e713af3138cc91fa14f3/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0898.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p58c-67jv-wg8j/GHSA-p58c-67jv-wg8j.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0898.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150400_150500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--911be8dc-d59c-4e61-98aa-5e0281ac56aa.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/46c3db74bcefc7346a3fc9a83eaa82e521022c79/2000.tsv","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0898.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1001.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0931","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0931.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1189","title":"Red Hat Linux pam_localuser PAM 模块缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 7.x 及 6.x 系统中 pam_localuser PAM 模块存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向该模块提交特制的输入数据触发缓冲区溢出，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞需要攻击者拥有本地系统访问权限，无法远程利用，但一旦成功利用可完全控制目标系统。受影响的系统包括 Red Hat Linux 6.x 和 7.x 系列版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1189"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:20.653","remediation":"升级 PAM 软件包至修复版本（Red Hat Linux 6.x 升级至 pam-0.72-26 及以上，7.x 升级至 pam-0.72-26及以上），或安装 Red Hat 2000 年 11 月发布的安全公告 RHSA-2000:088 对应更新。由于 Red Hat Linux 6.x/7.x 已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的 Red Hat Enterprise Linux 发行版，并确保 PAM 模块保持最新安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000358","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-082.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-120.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5747","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1189.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1189","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-1189.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1189.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b21976b5bf1b11783559cbe4f375f11636b79518/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-57c9-j2wv-xxm2/GHSA-57c9-j2wv-xxm2.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83026/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--cbfcebe5-4b71-4beb-a671-0932b34abcac.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1189.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/864adb9ddf294417a5a4e84f90f9adf54e9dca89/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0931.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0930","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0930.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1187","title":"Netscape Communicator HTML解析器缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Netscape 4.75 及更早版本的 HTML 解析器存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在表单字段中提交超长的 password 值触发该漏洞，导致任意命令执行。攻击者无需身份认证，只需诱导用户访问特制网页即可利用。该漏洞影响 Netscape Communicator/Navigator 4.75 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1187"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:20.427","remediation":"立即升级 Netscape Communicator/Navigator 至 4.76 或更高版本，该版本已修复 HTML 解析器在处理超长表单密码字段时的缓冲区溢出漏洞。由于 Netscape 4.x 系列已停止维护，建议彻底弃用该浏览器，改用 Firefox、Chrome 等仍在安全支持期内的现代浏览器。如无法立即升级，可在网络层面部署入侵检测规则（如 Snort）拦截包含超长表单字段的 HTTP 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000344","http://lists.suse.com/archives/suse-security-announce/2000-Nov/0005.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97500270012529&w=2","http://www.osvdb.org/7207","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-109.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5542","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1187.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1187","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-1187.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1187.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b21976b5bf1b11783559cbe4f375f11636b79518/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-rwpw-3689-qgwh/GHSA-rwpw-3689-qgwh.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/exploit.rules","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150500_150600.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1187.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d34152f0-e682-4739-8382-d391523078fa.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0930.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0930.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0930.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0929","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0929.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1178","title":"Joe 文本编辑器符号链接漏洞","description":"Joe 文本编辑器在异常退出时创建名为 DEADJOE 的救援副本文件，该过程会跟随符号链接，导致本地攻击者可通过预先创建指向其他用户文件的符号链接，当受害者的 Joe 编辑器会话崩溃时，救援文件将覆盖目标文件。该漏洞影响 Joe 文本编辑器的多个版本，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，利用条件为等待或诱导目标用户使用 Joe 编辑器时发生异常退出。漏洞危害等级为中危，CVSS 评分 5.5，可导致本地文件被非授权覆盖，影响系统文件完整性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1178"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:19.383","remediation":"升级 Joe 文本编辑器至 2.8 以上版本（如 Immunix OS 升级至 joe-2.8-42.62_StackGuard，Debian 升级至对应安全更新版本），该版本修复了异常退出时创建 DEADJOE 救援文件跟随符号链接的问题。如无法立即升级，可限制本地用户对 joe 的 SUID 权限或移除 joe 的 SUID 位：`chmod u-s /usr/bin/joe`，防止普通用户通过符号链接覆盖其他用户文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0227.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000356","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97500174210821&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001201","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-072.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-110.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1959","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5546","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1178.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1178","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-1178.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1178.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r44p-pj93-6hhq/GHSA-r44p-pj93-6hhq.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150500_150600.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-59.txt","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2000/20001122.data","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2000-072.nasl","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e1837836-ea35-452d-b965-f85ba038abdc.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0929.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0928","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0928.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1169","title":"OpenSSH SSH客户端 X11转发与agent转发安全限制绕过漏洞","description":"OpenSSH 2.3.0 之前版本的 SSH 客户端未正确禁用 X11 转发和代理转发功能，当用户使用 SSH 客户端连接到恶意的 SSH 服务器时，攻击者可通过精心构造的 SSH 服务器获取客户端 X11 显示的访问权限，从而窃听 X11 事件（如键盘输入），或获取 ssh-agent 的访问权限以窃取私钥。该漏洞影响所有运行 OpenSSH 2.3.0 之前版本的系统，攻击条件为用户主动连接至恶意 SSH 服务器，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1169"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:18.290","remediation":"升级 OpenSSH 至 2.3.0 或更高版本。在客户端 ssh_config 中设置 ForwardX11 no 和 ForwardAgent no 禁用 X11 和代理转发；使用 ssh -x 选项连接以关闭 X11 转发。如无法升级，在 /etc/ssh/ssh_config 中全局禁用 ForwardX11Trusted 并限制 SSH 仅连接可信服务器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0195.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0217.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000345","http://lists.suse.com/archives/suse-security-announce/2000-Nov/0004.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001118","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-068.php3","http://www.osvdb.org/2114","http://www.osvdb.org/6248","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-111.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1949","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5517","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1169.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1169","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-1169.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1169.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/ssh_forwarding.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jh35-33g7-ghxr/GHSA-jh35-33g7-ghxr.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150500_150600.json","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2000/20001118.data","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d37a5ed6-8435-4f3b-89bc-6cac1410dddc.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1169.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0928.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0926","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0926.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1162","title":"Artifex Ghostscript 符号链接攻击本地文件覆盖漏洞","description":"Ghostscript 5.10-16 之前版本存在符号链接攻击漏洞。本地攻击者可通过创建恶意的符号链接文件，诱使 Ghostscript 在处理临时文件时将其重定向至目标文件，从而覆盖系统中其他用户的文件。该漏洞利用条件为攻击者拥有本地访问权限，且目标系统上存在其他用户可写的临时目录。成功利用可导致非授权文件覆盖，影响系统完整性和可用性。","severity":"LOW","score":3.7,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1162"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:17.397","remediation":"升级 ghostscript 至 5.10-16 或更高版本（如 5.50、9.00 等现代版本）。若暂无法升级，可限制 /tmp 目录权限为 1777（粘滞位），并配置 AppArmor/SELinux 策略禁止 ghostscript 进程跟随符号链接写入非预期路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000343","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2000-041.0.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001123","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-074.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-114.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1990","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5563","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1162.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1162","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-1162.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1162.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-346g-3xvj-229v/GHSA-346g-3xvj-229v.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150400_150500.json","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2000/20001123.data","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1162.json","https://github.com/smartmanru/puppeteer/blob/39a9476177cf4949355b61fa6ac90a68de34aeb3/log.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/48d9bee10ba6f9c95b14d9de429f21fee40e28eb/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0926.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0924","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0924.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1137","title":"GNU ed 符号链接攻击本地文件覆盖漏洞","description":"GNU ed 在 0.2-18.1 之前版本中存在符号链接攻击漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在目标系统上创建恶意的符号链接，诱使 GNU ed 在处理文件时跟随该符号链接，从而覆盖其他用户的文件。该漏洞利用条件为攻击者拥有本地系统访问权限，无需特殊权限即可实施攻击。成功利用后可能导致敏感文件被篡改、数据完整性受损，甚至引发权限提升。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危，影响使用 GNU ed 的各类 Linux/Unix 系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1137"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:13.900","remediation":"升级 GNU ed 至 0.2-r4 或更高版本，该版本修复了临时文件创建的不安全行为。对于 Gentoo 系统，执行 emerge --sync && emerge -pv \">=sys-apps/ed-0.2-r4\" && emerge \">=sys-apps/ed-0.2-r4\" 完成更新。如无法升级，避免在受信任目录中以 root 身份使用 ed 编辑文件，并监控 /tmp 目录的符号链接攻击行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000359","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001129","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-076.php3","http://www.osvdb.org/6491","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-123.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5723","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1137.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1137","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-1137.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1137.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qpw8-2v6f-pwj8/GHSA-qpw8-2v6f-pwj8.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/gentoo_GLSA-200410-07.nasl","https://github.com/gentoo-mirror/gentoo/blob/2791ee2694415282d98c8beb1ca7658a5e871297/metadata/glsa/glsa-200410-07.xml","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150400_150500.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2000-076.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1137.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0924.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0837","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0837.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1186","title":"NCSA HTTPd PHF CGI 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"PHF（电话簿查询）CGI 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可向目标 Web 服务器发送包含大量参数及超长 MIME 头的特制 HTTP 请求，触发缓冲区溢出，进而以 Web 服务器进程权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响运行 PHF CGI 程序的 Linux/x86 系统，攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1186"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:20.317","remediation":"立即删除或禁用 `/cgi-bin/phf` 脚本，该程序并非 Apache 标准组件，无正常业务用途。建议升级至 Apache 2.x 或更高版本（已移除 phf），或在 Web 服务器配置中禁止访问 `/cgi-bin/phf` 路径。作为临时缓解措施，可在防火墙或反向代理层面拦截对 `/cgi-bin/phf` 的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0221.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5970","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/211","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fe843ab2b4a415ff4c1b33508a5c7bbbe8d1116c/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1186.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1186","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1186.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be9b320c2a949cb73c32157503bdf6fad99f369e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1186.json","https://github.com/anchore/syft/blob/29fd7d0dec81cf03e0a1194a1985c7c893bb2396/syft/pkg/cataloger/internal/cpegenerate/candidate_by_package_type.go","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1186.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88468/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a46f5787-696e-43f6-9db5-35088fc488d9.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/fil