S 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1176"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:19.160","remediation":"立即升级至 YaBB SE 1.5.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 search.pl 目录遍历漏洞。如无法升级，手动修改 search.pl 脚本，对 catsearch 参数进行严格过滤，删除所有 `../` 及空字节等路径跳转字符，并使用 Perl 的 taint 模式（`#!/usr/bin/perl -T`）增强输入安全性。同时在 Web 服务器（Apache）层面配置 mod_rewrite 规则，拦截包含 `..` 的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0110.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1921","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20387","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8ac21ad6117514c2d2073c3d7d77e898bf2697d2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1176.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1176","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1176.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c6904371163d9b81521151d4181001adee1b956/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1176.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/986f88b713cae42a05d283e54e6fe229a76d2603/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x4gh-8p78-vxxx/GHSA-x4gh-8p78-vxxx.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/yabbse_cmd_exec.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1176.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--78e88521-0caa-46d3-b8a3-976a83622ada.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1921/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0832.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0831","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0831.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1175","title":"Jan Hubicka Koules 1.4 Svgalib 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Koules 1.4 是一款运行于 Linux 平台、基于 Svgalib 图形库的太空射击游戏，其命令行参数处理存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向程序传递超长命令行参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Koules 1.4 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。由于需要本地访问权限，攻击者需先获取系统普通用户权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1175"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:19.030","remediation":"建议升级到 Debian 等发行版提供的 koules 1.4-28 或更新版本（X11 编译版，已修复缓冲区溢出问题）。若使用旧版 svgalib 二进制，立即移除 koules 二进制文件的 setuid 权限：`chmod u-s /usr/games/koules`，或直接卸载该软件包（`apt remove koules`）。限制仅受信任用户可执行该二进制文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/145823","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1967","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20410","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbe4faa82ea56a60f688d9bd92ecf2ac8f256a8a/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1175.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1175","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1175.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c6904371163d9b81521151d4181001adee1b956/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1175.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/faa6652cee3bb289cdb421c716af926ca2b60de5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3v35-rfwh-3mc8/GHSA-3v35-rfwh-3mc8.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1175.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1967/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150500_150600.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--72a78112-a60f-4152-8657-facc06a48c34.owl","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0831.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0830","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0830.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1174","title":"Ethereal AFS ACL 解析器缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Ethereal（现称 Wireshark）0.8.13 及更早版本的 AFS ACL 解析器中存在多处缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可向目标系统发送特制的网络数据包，在 username 字段中填入超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出，从而在目标系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响所有运行受影响版本 Ethereal 的系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，危害严重。目前官方已停止维护该版本，建议用户升级至最新版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1174"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:18.900","remediation":"升级 Ethereal 至 0.8.14 或更高版本，该版本已修复 AFS ACL 解析器中的缓冲区溢出问题。由于 Ethereal 已更名为 Wireshark，建议直接安装最新版 Wireshark（如 4.x 系列）。如无法升级，可在抓包时禁用 AFS 协议解析：编辑 -> 首选项 -> 协议 -> AFS，取消勾选「解析 AFS 协议」。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0251.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000342","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001122a","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-116.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1972","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5557","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20414","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1174.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/